{"id":"wb-7-1575","name":"弹子石摩崖造像","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"彈子石摩崖造像","text":"弹子石摩崖造像位于重庆市南岸区大佛寺外山门外长江边，明夏时所凿（1365年），大佛寺是重庆古刹，其寺内五佛殿有明永乐十九年（1421年）摩崖造像。重庆大佛是三峡库区规模最大的摩崖石刻大佛造像，也是中国历史上唯一可以确认的由农民起义军政权所造的佛像。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BD%88%E5%AD%90%E7%9F%B3%E6%91%A9%E5%B4%96%E9%80%A0%E5%83%8F","revisionId":90657062,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90657062","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c4e3389ef2708792f0d777bf.jpg","title":"弹子石摩崖造像照片.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%BC%B9%E5%AD%90%E7%9F%B3%E6%91%A9%E5%B4%96%E9%80%A0%E5%83%8F%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a4/%E5%BC%B9%E5%AD%90%E7%9F%B3%E6%91%A9%E5%B4%96%E9%80%A0%E5%83%8F%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Nekitarc","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Danzishi Grottoes","width":320,"height":253}}